<title>UK: Brazil Realty sets $75 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil Realty sets $75 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRAZIL REALTY EMPREEDIMENT</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     10.5	MATURITY	.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.559    PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.559    SPREAD	+395 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  0.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5 YR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AND PUT 22.JUL.02 AT 99.75</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
